<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="page legaldoc">
  <h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">Effective <%= co.EFFECTIVE_DATE %> · Applies to all services and tools provided by <%= co.COMPANY_NAME %> (<%= co.PRODUCT_NAME %>)</p>

  <h2>Monthly and yearly plans</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Cancel any time in the customer portal. You keep access until the end of the paid period and are not charged again.</li>
    <li>If the API or tool does not work as described and we cannot fix it within 5 business days of your report, we refund the affected billing period in full.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Overage and pay-as-you-go usage</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pay-as-you-go plans have <b>no monthly fee and no automatic charge</b>. You can stop at any time without notice. Months with no usage produce no invoice.</li>
    <li>Usage fees cover API calls and tool jobs already completed and are therefore non-refundable, except where usage was recorded incorrectly (for example double counting). In that case we correct the invoice before payment, or refund the difference in full if already paid.</li>
    <li>If a tool does not work as described and we cannot fix the problem within 5 business days of your report, we refund the usage fees for the affected month in full, or void the invoice if it has not yet been paid.</li>
    <li>Report any discrepancy within 15 days of the invoice date. We verify against the usage log visible in your customer portal.</li>
  </ul>


  <h2>All services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Duplicate or erroneous charges</b> are always refunded in full.</li>
    <li>No refunds are given for government fees or outcomes decided by third parties or authorities.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Email <% if (co.COMPANY_EMAIL) { %><a href="mailto:<%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %>"><%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %></a><% } else { %>our support address<% } %> with the email used at checkout, the invoice number (INV-…) or <%= co.PAY.name %> order number, and the reason.</li>
    <li>We reply within 2 business days. Approved refunds are issued through <%= co.PAY.name %> to the original payment method within 5–10 business days, depending on your card issuer.</li>
    <li>You may also contact <%= co.PAY.name %> directly via the links in your receipt email; as Merchant of Record it may process refunds under its <a href="<%= co.PAY.buyerTermsUrl %>" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Buyer Terms</a>.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
  <p>Please contact us before disputing a charge with your bank. We resolve most issues within 2 business days.</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
